# Render: vhs assets/tapes/custom-style.tape (from the repo root)

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 960
Set Height 230
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms

Hide
Type "export PS1='> ' && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "bun examples/custom-style.ts"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Screenshot assets/custom-style.png
